[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Application operation was reported by the user; this Port packaging
has not been validated on FreeBSD.
Use an isolated test jail before deployment. The module is not enabled
by installation. Review %%ETCDIR%%/mod_uploader.conf.sample, set the public
UploaderBaseUrl, and only then include a copy from Apache configuration.
Storage is outside DocumentRoot. Do not publish it through an Alias.
Downloads are attachments. Thumbnails are optional and need ImageMagick
resource/coder policy. Keep admin/mail restricted to trusted clients.
Read the accompanying migration report for outstanding security work.
EOM
}
]
